node_modules/
# Every .env variant, not just the plain one. tools/gmail-auth.js OVERWRITES the refresh token
# in .env, so authorising a second mailbox means keeping a backup of the first beside it — and
# a secrets file one careless `git add .` away from being published is not worth the risk.
.env*
.vercel/
uploads/
*.log
.DS_Store
*-service-account*.json
google-cloud-key.json
# The partner directory's own data, written here whenever the app or a tool runs against the
# local store. contacts.json is 5,500 people, phone-book.json is his whole phone book — every
# customer's mobile number. They belong in the S3 bucket, never in a public repository, and
# they were one careless `git add .` from being published.
contacts.json
contacts-pending.json
google-firms.json
phone-book.json

